      "title": "Insecticides (India) Limited Announces Board Changes, Effective May 28, 2026",
      "body": "Insecticides (India) Limited held a board meeting on May 28, 2026. The company took note of the resignation of Mrs. Nikunj Aggarwal (DIN: 06569091) as Whole Time Director of the company with immediate effect. Mrs. Nikunj Aggarwal confirmed that there is no other material reason for resignation other than those mentioned in her resignation letter. Mr. Sanskar Aggarwal (DIN: 09675297) was appointed as Whole Time Director (Additional) of the company for a term of five consecutive years effective from May 28, 2026 till May 27, 2031, liable to retire by rotation and as Director (Additional) in Kaeros Research Limited - formerly known as Kaeros Research Private Limited (a wholly owned subsidiary) with effect from May 28, 2026. Mr. Sanskar Aggarwal (DIN: 09675297), born into a family of passionat",
